The FreeBSD DRM subsystem port carrying riscv64 support and the verisilicon
DC8200 display driver used by the StarFive JH7110, as found on the VisionFive 2.

Provides dmabuf, ttm, drm and verisilicon. The GPU itself comes from
graphics/pvrsrvkm-kmod; the open-source PowerVR driver in this source tree is
not built by default because it claims the same device and cannot coexist
with it.
